            "review_title": "Review at Non Nuoc Bar",
            "review_text": "Evelyn N\n1 contribution\n0\nWould come back just for the staff :)\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nWe stayed here for a wedding and frequented Non Nuoc Bar for snackies and drinks. Nhat and Quyen were amazing; friendly personalities and helpful. We even asked for non-traditional drinks and they were open to making them on the fly, and the drinks were delicious!! The snacks were also really tasty, and fairly priced. Can't wait to visit again.\nInsider tip:\nPizza was light and delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 13, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
